52 = 1981463.6448. ✓\n\ns = 1981463.6448 + 400 = 1981863.6448 ✓\n\nv = 1981863.6448 / (425/6) = 1981863.6448 × 6 / 425\n1981863.6448 × 6 = 11891181.8688\n11891181.8688 / 425:\n425 × 27000 = 11475000\n11891181.8688 - 11475000 = 416181.8688\n425 × 979 = 416075\n416181.8688 - 416075 = 106.8688\n106.8688/425 = 0.2515\nv = 27979.2515 ≈ 27979 km/h.\n\nSo the answer is 27979 km/h.", "tool_calls": [], "created_at": 1786671614}
